The [[Poison Dagger]] is a [[weapon]] attained by combining a [[Dagger]] with a [[Pestilence Flask]]. Not only does it inflict {{icon/poison}} on hit, but it also attacks more quickly and deals more damage than the base [[Dagger]], making it strictly better.
